1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730
"I have nothing to wear!"
“我没什么可穿的！”

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:10,760
You might have said to yourself, feeling slightly distressed, wardrobe door wide open, hours before going to a party or important event.
你可能在参加一个派对或重要活动的前几个小时，看着敞开的衣柜门，略带苦恼地对自己说过这句话。

3
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,450
Casual or formal?
穿休闲装还是正装呢？

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,220
Is this too flamboyant?
这件是不是太张扬了？

5
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,330
Should I look more demure?
我是不是应该看起来更端庄些呢？

6
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:19,600
How strictly should we follow fashion rules?
我们应该多严格地遵循时尚规则呢？

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,780
'Never mix patterns' is one of them.
“永远不要混搭图案”就是其中一条规则。

8
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:28,760
Clashing prints might make Coco Chanel spin in her grave but gets the seal of approval of some stylists nowadays.
相互冲突的印花图案可能会让可可·香奈儿在九泉之下不得安宁，但如今却得到了一些造型师的认可。

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:34,330
"It's edgy," says Martine Alexander, adviser to British TV actresses.
“这很前卫。”

10
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:37,650
"Matching everything makes you look like you've tried too hard.
英国电视女演员的顾问玛蒂娜·亚历山大说，“把所有东西都搭配得严丝合缝会让你看起来用力过猛。

11
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,900
Style should look effortless."
时尚风格应该看起来毫不费力。”

12
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:45,450
Well, just be careful not to make people's eyes go funny when they look at you, I say.
嗯，我觉得还是要小心点，别让别人看你的时候觉得辣眼睛。

13
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,480
Men have the issue of white socks.
男士们有白色袜子的问题。

14
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:58,620
"Unless you're exercising there is absolutely no appropriate moment to wear white socks," says Alex Bilmes, editor of the men's magazine Esquire.
“除非你在运动，否则任何时刻穿白色袜子都不太合适。”男士杂志《君子》的编辑亚历克斯·比尔姆斯说。

15
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:05,800
And he adds: "These types of rules exist to make sure fashion innocents don't make such a bad mistake."
他还补充道：“这些规则的存在是为了确保那些时尚小白不会犯这么严重的错误。”

16
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:10,610
We all know that white socks are usually bulky and may look cheap.
我们都知道白色袜子通常比较臃肿，而且可能看起来很廉价。

17
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:20,460
But there's a long British tradition of men wearing socks with sandals so... Maybe critics should put a sock in it and let us wear what we are comfortable with.
但是英国一直有男士穿凉鞋配袜子的传统，所以……也许批评者们应该闭嘴，让我们穿自己觉得舒服的衣服。

18
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:24,800
When you look a particular way you are sending a message about yourself.
当你以某种特定的方式打扮自己时，你就在传达关于你自己的信息。

19
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:30,420
It's not a good idea to go to a job interview wearing shorts or showing too much cleavage.
穿着短裤去参加工作面试或者露出太多乳沟可不是个好主意。

20
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:32,910
Or going to the market in your pyjamas.
穿着睡衣去市场也不行。

21
00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:36,140
But, whatever you wear, do it with confidence.
但是，无论你穿什么，都要自信地去穿。

22
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:40,600
Designer Gianni Versace said it all: "Don't be into trends.
设计师詹尼·范思哲说得很到位：“不要追逐潮流。

23
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:48,980
Don't make fashion own you, but you decide what you are, and what you want to express, by the way you dress and the way you live."
不要让时尚主宰你，而是你要通过自己的穿着方式和生活方式来决定你是谁，以及你想要表达什么。”
